{"id": "github-unfccc-cop-analysis", "kind": "html", "url": "https://github.com/judyjwxie/unfccc-cop-analysis", "canonical_url": "https://github.com/judyjwxie/unfccc-cop-analysis", "title": "Tracing inclusivity at UNFCCC conferences through side events and interest group dynamics", "description": "Contribute to judyjwxie/unfccc-cop-analysis development by creating an account on GitHub.", "site": "GitHub", "authors": [], "published": null, "modified": null, "language": "en", "sections": [{"heading": "Latest commit", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "History", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Folders and files", "level": 2, "paragraphs": [{"n": 1, "text": "Name"}, {"n": 2, "text": "Name"}, {"n": 3, "text": "Last commit message"}, {"n": 4, "text": "Last commit date"}, {"n": 5, "text": "analysis"}, {"n": 6, "text": "analysis"}, {"n": 7, "text": "graph-files"}, {"n": 8, "text": "graph-files"}, {"n": 9, "text": "network-results"}, {"n": 10, "text": "network-results"}, {"n": 11, "text": ".gitattributes"}, {"n": 12, "text": ".gitattributes"}, {"n": 13, "text": ".gitignore"}, {"n": 14, "text": ".gitignore"}, {"n": 15, "text": "LICENSE"}, {"n": 16, "text": "LICENSE"}, {"n": 17, "text": "README.md"}, {"n": 18, "text": "README.md"}]}, {"heading": "Repository files navigation", "level": 2, "paragraphs": [{"n": 19, "text": "This GitHub repository contains the source code for tracing UNFCCC COP side event topics and network relationships of their organisers. This work uses open-source secondary data and the data sources can be found in the Methods section of the manuscript."}, {"n": 20, "text": "Any correspondence can be made to Judy Xie: j.xie20@imperial.ac.uk"}]}, {"heading": "Software Requirements", "level": 2, "paragraphs": [{"n": 21, "text": "The scripts are written in Python (Version 3.10.13) using Jupyter Notebooks, R (Version 4.3.1), and Gephi version 0.10."}]}, {"heading": "Overview", "level": 2, "paragraphs": [{"n": 22, "text": "This repository includes an analysis folder and two special output folders."}, {"n": 23, "text": "In the delegates subfolder, the main data sources are the UNFCCC List of participants: on-site participation (accessed 31 Jan 2024) and the anonymised list of fossil fuel lobbyist developed by the Kick Big Polluters Out coalition (accessed 30 Jul 2024). They are presented as the participant nomination sankey diagram nodes and links data located in delegates/sankey."}, {"n": 24, "text": "In the orgs subfolder, the main data sources are the UNFCCC admitted IGO database (accessed 13 Feb 2024) and admitted NGO database (accessed 31 Jan 2024)."}, {"n": 25, "text": "In the side_events subfolder, data are extracted from the UNFCCC SEORS database (accessed 14 Mar 2024)."}, {"n": 26, "text": "graph-files includes the four networks visualised in the manuscript and can be opened using the publicly available Gephi software."}, {"n": 27, "text": "network-results includes the network statistics of nodes and edges from the analysis."}]}, {"heading": "About", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Resources", "level": 3, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Stars", "level": 3, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Watchers", "level": 3, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Forks", "level": 3, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Releases", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Packages", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Contributors", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Languages", "level": 2, "paragraphs": []}], "links": [{"url": "https://github.com/judyjwxie/unfccc-cop-analysis/tree/main/analysis", "host": "github.com", "kind": "internal", "anchor": "analysis", "paragraph": 5, "section": "Folders and files", "context": "analysis"}, {"url": "https://github.com/judyjwxie/unfccc-cop-analysis/tree/main/analysis", "host": "github.com", "kind": "internal", "anchor": "analysis", "paragraph": 6, "section": "Folders and files", "context": "analysis"}, {"url": "https://github.com/judyjwxie/unfccc-cop-anal